v {xschem version=3.4.7 file_version=1.2
* divider_iq.sym -- block symbol for the I/Q divide-by-2 cell (issue #422).
* Pin order (VDD, GND, CLK2X, RESETB, CLK, CLK90) matches divider_iq.sch's
* iopin/ipin/opin declaration order.
}
G {}
K {type=subcircuit
format="X@name @pinlist @symname"
template="name=x1"
}
V {}
S {}
E {}
L 4 -100 -80 100 -80 {}
L 4 100 -80 100 80 {}
L 4 100 80 -100 80 {}
L 4 -100 80 -100 -80 {}
L 4 0 -100 0 -80 {}
L 4 0 80 0 100 {}
